            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba na Joshuwa achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aambire Aiziraeli atsambule midzi ya kuchimbirira, dza viratu nrivyoalagiza kutsupira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili yeyesi aolagaye mutu bila kumanya achimbirire hiko. Hiko kundakala kpwahali kpwa kuchimbirira kumchimbira hiye aendzaye kuriphiza chisasi kpwa kuolagirwa mutuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye muolagadzi andachimbirira mudzi mmwengawapho, akaime ryangoni na asemurire vilongozi a nyo mudzi ro richiromreha. Chisha aho vilongozi andamuhala akamuonyese phatu ili asagale kahi zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichikala mutu analonda kudziriphiza kpwa sababu ya kuolagirwa mutuwe andamlunga kuko, vilongozi taaruhusiwa kumlavya yuya muolagadzi mana kayaolaga kumanya ela kpwa bahati mbaya mana kala taphana uadui kahi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muolagadzi andasala mo mudzini hadi lau riamulwe ni Aiziraeli osi na ni akale kuko hadi chifo cha mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu wa wakati uho ndiphofwa, ndipho muolagadzi anaweza kuuya kaya, mudzi ariouchimbira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
